---
import CaptureForm from './CaptureForm.astro';
import Constellation from './Constellation.astro';
---
<section class="final-section" aria-labelledby="final-heading">
  <div class="final-constellation" aria-hidden="true"><Constellation /></div>
  <div class="final-inner">
    <p class="final-eyebrow">The Archive begins here</p>
    <h2 class="final-headline" id="final-heading">Begin at the Beginning</h2>
    <p class="final-sub">Receive Chapter One of <em>Recursive Prophet</em> and your invitation to the Archive.</p>
    <p class="final-sub">The following day, you’ll receive the first real conversation between Chris and T∆RS—preserved before either understood that their collaboration was becoming a story.</p>
    <div class="final-form-wrap">
      <CaptureForm
        idPrefix="final-chapter-one"
        label="Email address"
        placeholder="you@example.com"
        buttonClass="btn-paper"
        tone="dark"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
